WEBVTT

01:42.018 --> 01:46.940
THE SHINY BLACK NOSE BEFORE ME

02:12.465 --> 02:16.553
<i>He's going to kill me.
I've got to call for help.</i>

02:26.312 --> 02:29.107
<i>Calm down. Come on, calm down.</i>

02:30.108 --> 02:31.776
Eat me, Legoshi.

02:31.860 --> 02:33.945
<i>The meat of a living herbivore.</i>

02:35.572 --> 02:36.990
<i>It drives me mad.</i>

02:55.925 --> 02:57.260
Seven?

03:08.855 --> 03:10.273
You're Seven, right?

03:12.150 --> 03:13.151
Yes.

03:14.485 --> 03:15.486
This room...

03:17.196 --> 03:20.408
doesn't get electricity. What should I do?

03:21.492 --> 03:26.831
Call... call the electric company
and tell them your address.

03:26.915 --> 03:28.124
Electric company?

03:28.708 --> 03:32.545
Yes. They can turn your power on remotely.

03:38.676 --> 03:40.345
Do you have a phone?

03:41.429 --> 03:43.973
I'm sure you can
find their number on Zoozle.

03:45.141 --> 03:50.146
Actually... I canceled my phone plan
when I dropped out of high school.

03:54.817 --> 03:59.781
<i>World history, foreign language,
high school equivalency exam...</i>

04:00.657 --> 04:02.200
You're still a teenager?

04:02.700 --> 04:05.578
I'm 17.

04:05.662 --> 04:07.789
I work at an udon shop.

04:15.797 --> 04:18.716
Aren't those shoes a little plain
for a 17-year-old?

04:19.342 --> 04:23.805
There aren't many choices
for large carnivores.

04:23.888 --> 04:26.057
I guess that's true.

04:27.475 --> 04:29.811
I work for that brand.

04:31.229 --> 04:32.522
You do?

04:33.523 --> 04:34.857
Thanks for the shoes.

04:37.235 --> 04:41.281
<i>Talking like this calms my appetite.</i>

04:42.282 --> 04:43.449
So...

04:44.659 --> 04:46.786
My name is Legoshi.

04:47.829 --> 04:50.623
- I should have introduced myself before.
- Those scars...

04:54.544 --> 04:55.795
Don't touch me!

04:56.296 --> 04:57.130
What?

04:57.839 --> 04:58.840
Please.

05:03.219 --> 05:06.055
I'll look up
the electric company's number for you.

05:11.436 --> 05:12.645
Hey...

05:14.147 --> 05:16.774
This might sound strange coming from me,

05:18.484 --> 05:21.988
but why aren't you running away?

05:23.197 --> 05:24.073
What?

05:30.038 --> 05:34.250
It's been a while since
a carnivore called me by my name.

05:34.334 --> 05:35.668
I appreciate it.

05:48.556 --> 05:50.725
Apparently one sip set him off,

05:50.808 --> 05:53.811
and he ended up
eating his girlfriend's finger.

05:53.895 --> 05:56.981
- For real?
- Yeah. It was on the news.

05:57.523 --> 05:59.692
This stuff is crazy.

06:00.234 --> 06:02.487
Are you sure it's safe?

06:02.570 --> 06:04.489
It's fine!

06:05.114 --> 06:05.948
Here.

06:12.163 --> 06:13.164
It's empty!

06:15.291 --> 06:16.250
You little...

06:17.168 --> 06:18.711
You're such a jerk.

06:24.967 --> 06:30.598
My, oh my.
Pardon my rudeness, Your Highness.

06:31.849 --> 06:32.850
I'll throw this out.

06:33.476 --> 06:35.895
Don't worry about it.

06:35.978 --> 06:40.316
If we mess with you,
we'll get expelled in an instant.

06:40.399 --> 06:44.403
Get on the Horns Conglomerate's bad side,
and you'll never get a high-level job.

06:45.530 --> 06:46.656
Give me that.

06:49.575 --> 06:50.827
I said give it to me.

06:52.495 --> 06:53.746
Meat intoxication?

06:55.331 --> 06:57.625
Those are meat withdrawal symptoms.

06:59.502 --> 07:00.878
From this?

07:00.962 --> 07:02.630
I said give it back!

07:04.340 --> 07:07.760
<i>Most carnivores are rendered powerless
when their tails are pulled.</i>

07:11.973 --> 07:15.226
<i>The Shishi-Gumi taught me that.</i>

07:16.018 --> 07:17.228
Listen up.

07:17.812 --> 07:22.650
The strength of a lion is just a weapon.
Don't misuse it.

07:30.658 --> 07:31.701
Amazing.

07:32.910 --> 07:34.078
It's beautiful.

07:35.413 --> 07:37.331
It doesn't hurt anymore?

07:37.999 --> 07:39.917
It's not as bad as I thought.

07:42.295 --> 07:44.672
Why are you showing it to me?

07:46.466 --> 07:50.052
You're the only one who knows
I was working in the Black Market.

07:50.553 --> 07:52.555
I guess we have a connection.

07:53.931 --> 07:55.850
You wanted someone to know?

07:56.350 --> 07:58.978
- No.
- You're worried, aren't you?

08:00.313 --> 08:01.772
No, I'm not.

08:01.856 --> 08:04.650
We deer shed our antlers once a year.

08:04.734 --> 08:08.571
So losing a body part doesn't
scare me in the least.

08:08.654 --> 08:09.906
That's why--

08:35.515 --> 08:36.724
I...

08:37.308 --> 08:39.769
I... Well...

08:41.354 --> 08:44.440
I'm sorry. I...

08:44.524 --> 08:47.652
- Just forget that ever happened.
- Sure. I'll forget all about it.

08:47.735 --> 08:50.321
Wait! What do you mean, you'll forget?

08:50.404 --> 08:53.032
- That was my first kiss!
- Calm down.

08:53.115 --> 08:54.116
Calm down?

08:54.200 --> 08:57.495
You kissed me to show compassion
to a wounded herbivore.

08:58.162 --> 09:00.122
That's the end of it.

09:01.582 --> 09:03.584
How can you say that?

09:04.252 --> 09:06.379
That really hurts.

09:07.255 --> 09:10.007
Thanks for your help with the club.

09:18.516 --> 09:22.395
<i>Nothing good ever comes
from interspecies relationships.</i>

09:24.230 --> 09:25.815
<i>Why did she do that?</i>

09:27.942 --> 09:31.070
<i>I thought I'd cut ties with carnivores,</i>

09:31.153 --> 09:33.239
<i>yet they're still clinging to me.</i>

10:43.893 --> 10:46.687
We've been waiting
for more than a half hour.

10:46.771 --> 10:50.149
He said he'd get
Shishi-Gumi back on its feet, but...

11:12.630 --> 11:13.464
Jimma?

11:26.143 --> 11:27.061
Stop!

11:36.445 --> 11:39.115
Stop! Calm down, Jimma!

11:44.662 --> 11:47.748
What the hell is wrong with you?

11:47.832 --> 11:49.375
Did that guy put you up to this?

11:50.751 --> 11:52.044
I don't know.

11:52.128 --> 11:53.129
What?

12:01.387 --> 12:02.638
Boss?

12:02.721 --> 12:06.058
Dealers shouldn't use their own product.

12:06.559 --> 12:07.560
What?

12:07.643 --> 12:10.187
Dealers and product?
What are you going on about?

12:12.440 --> 12:15.151
This isn't just
a regular energy drink, is it?

12:18.154 --> 12:24.243
Kines contains traces of
herbivore bones and meat.

12:24.326 --> 12:29.540
Drinking it fills you with energy
and satisfies cravings for meat.

12:30.749 --> 12:35.713
However, the more you drink it,
the less satisfying it becomes.

12:36.755 --> 12:41.010
Before you know it, you're looking for
real meat at the Black Market.

12:41.635 --> 12:45.014
The Black Market is thriving,
thanks to the Shishi-Gumi.

12:46.932 --> 12:51.729
But when someone who's
tasted real meat drinks it...

12:55.107 --> 12:57.151
I get it now.

13:03.699 --> 13:05.576
Take it to this address.

13:05.659 --> 13:09.747
Gardona, Algama... Center Street?

13:10.289 --> 13:12.500
You want us to sell this to the public?

13:13.000 --> 13:15.711
You're just delivering it.

13:15.794 --> 13:19.840
Your ugly faces won't get any sales,
no matter how good the product.

13:20.591 --> 13:22.092
We haven't agreed to anything.

13:23.511 --> 13:25.596
Just because you got one piece of ivory

13:25.679 --> 13:28.015
doesn't make you Shishi-Gumi's boss.

13:28.724 --> 13:31.227
Yes, you're right.

13:37.316 --> 13:38.817
How about this, then?

13:50.663 --> 13:53.541
Oh? It's Lamb Chop.

13:53.624 --> 13:55.918
Inspecting the sales floor
on your day off?

13:56.001 --> 13:58.837
You sure are a hard worker.

13:58.921 --> 14:00.756
Just like us.

14:02.383 --> 14:06.971
<i>Here I was enjoying this sunny day off.
Just my luck.</i>

14:07.054 --> 14:09.390
You're in the herbivore division,
Lamb Chop.

14:09.473 --> 14:11.392
You should take it easy.

14:12.059 --> 14:13.018
You're right.

14:13.602 --> 14:18.941
<i>Don't worry. Just laugh it off.
That's my secret to success.</i>

14:19.024 --> 14:21.402
We carnivores have it tough.

14:21.485 --> 14:24.822
- All you need to do is smile.
- Excuse me...

14:28.576 --> 14:31.287
These are a little too small.

14:35.541 --> 14:36.834
A friend of yours, Lamb Chop?

14:37.960 --> 14:38.878
I'm her neighbor.

14:39.628 --> 14:43.966
You scared me.
I thought he was your boyfriend.

14:44.049 --> 14:45.509
- I'm not.
- No.

14:46.218 --> 14:50.222
Also, her name is Seven. Not Lamb Chop.

14:51.557 --> 14:53.225
Is that her work nickname?

14:53.726 --> 14:57.980
Yes, exactly.
Just a little joke between adults. Right?

14:59.815 --> 15:03.360
We're not trying to bully her or anything.

15:05.779 --> 15:09.742
Come to think of it, that is pretty mean.
Who started that? Was it you?

15:09.825 --> 15:11.452
No way, it was the manager!

15:11.952 --> 15:15.205
Anyway, sorry for butting in.
See you at the office.

15:16.040 --> 15:17.499
Goodbye, Seven.

15:18.876 --> 15:20.336
<i>What the...</i>

15:21.670 --> 15:25.466
<i>I've worked so hard and put up
with their bullying for so long.</i>

15:25.966 --> 15:26.967
Are you okay?

15:27.718 --> 15:29.929
It looked like they were bothering you.

15:30.763 --> 15:32.139
<i>And now this?</i>

15:34.600 --> 15:36.769
So you thought
you'd step in and save the day?

15:36.852 --> 15:37.853
What?

15:41.774 --> 15:43.734
I'm sorry! I...

15:43.817 --> 15:46.570
Are you upset
that they thought I was your boyfriend?

15:46.654 --> 15:48.697
I did deny it, you know.

15:48.781 --> 15:51.784
<i>What a child. What a brat!</i>

15:51.867 --> 15:54.286
<i>- Why?</i>
- If you just tell them I was helping you...

15:55.579 --> 15:59.708
What makes you think a kid like you
has more of a right to speak than me?

15:59.792 --> 16:01.961
You don't know
a thing about the real world.

16:02.044 --> 16:03.796
Yet you shut them up with a few words.

16:03.879 --> 16:05.881
You didn't even
have to put on a fake smile!

16:06.465 --> 16:09.218
Just by being a big carnivore!

16:09.301 --> 16:11.428
Hey, wolf! I'll report you!

16:12.972 --> 16:14.098
I'm okay!

16:19.311 --> 16:21.355
<i>I hadn't even thought about it.</i>

16:21.939 --> 16:26.193
<i>She's experienced hardships</i>

16:26.860 --> 16:28.862
<i>that I can't even fathom.</i>

16:39.456 --> 16:40.457
Seven?

16:41.875 --> 16:45.504
Why'd you follow me here?
I just want to drink by myself.

16:46.755 --> 16:48.424
I'm sorry.

16:48.507 --> 16:51.719
I acted without thinking
about your feelings.

16:54.388 --> 16:55.514
Cut it out.

16:56.181 --> 17:00.477
As an adult, getting an apology
from someone who owes you one

17:00.561 --> 17:02.229
just makes you feel worse.

17:03.063 --> 17:04.398
Then what should I do?

17:05.858 --> 17:07.943
You don't have to say anything.

17:08.569 --> 17:11.530
It's not your fault. Obviously.

17:14.033 --> 17:15.617
So, I shouldn't respond either?

17:17.119 --> 17:18.370
You really are naive.

17:33.677 --> 17:37.598
If this was your own money,
what would you eat?

17:38.098 --> 17:40.517
Shut up. You'll get yourself killed.

17:53.155 --> 17:54.156
Gohin, is that you?

17:59.620 --> 18:03.040
Nope. We're the 500 Cornered Rats!

18:06.293 --> 18:07.586
Are you okay?

18:08.587 --> 18:09.838
Hey!

18:09.922 --> 18:11.298
Wait!

18:11.381 --> 18:14.843
Over there, too! What do we do?
That's Shishi-Gumi's money!

18:14.927 --> 18:16.762
You think I don't know that?

18:22.851 --> 18:23.977
So long!

18:27.606 --> 18:29.274
Get back here!

18:30.901 --> 18:35.197
<i>Stealing from the wicked is our policy.</i>

18:36.031 --> 18:37.908
<i>By mobilizing all 500 of us,</i>

18:37.991 --> 18:41.537
<i>we can control both the Black Market
and mainstream society alike.</i>

18:42.454 --> 18:44.790
<i>It's a pretty fun gig.</i>

19:03.433 --> 19:06.562
It was you who stole
the mayor's gold watch, wasn't it?

19:06.645 --> 19:07.479
Admit it!

19:11.483 --> 19:16.697
It's no skin off our noses
if a few of you rat punks die.

19:20.576 --> 19:22.452
All lives are equal.

19:23.453 --> 19:24.913
Mr. Yahya!

19:25.414 --> 19:29.418
Whether it's big oafs like yourselves,

19:29.501 --> 19:33.088
little critters like this guy,

19:33.630 --> 19:35.257
or even myself.

19:36.550 --> 19:41.221
We're all the same.
All life is equally insignificant.

19:42.681 --> 19:48.478
And it's my job to save
those insignificant lives.

19:52.816 --> 19:53.817
Those bastards.

19:54.484 --> 19:56.361
Looking down on us rats.

19:56.445 --> 19:59.281
It looks like your dirty work
has caught up with you.

19:59.781 --> 20:01.742
So? What about the matter we discussed?

20:02.701 --> 20:08.332
It doesn't appear to be
Doku-Gumi, Inari-Gumi, or Madara-Gumi.

20:08.415 --> 20:10.042
Meaning it was Shishi-Gumi?

20:10.125 --> 20:13.921
Doubt it. They're out of a boss right now.

20:14.004 --> 20:16.131
They're in no position
to be dealing Kines.

20:16.757 --> 20:21.303
Seems the stuff is making the rounds
outside the Black Market as well.

20:21.386 --> 20:22.221
UDON BEBEBE

20:22.304 --> 20:25.057
<i>So it's being distributed
among the public after all?</i>

20:25.140 --> 20:26.475
Have a good night.

20:27.476 --> 20:33.023
<i>That's right. It's getting into the hands
of young carnivores at an alarming rate.</i>

20:34.233 --> 20:39.571
<i>According to forensics,
it seems to contain illicit substances.</i>

20:40.239 --> 20:45.160
<i>It's especially dangerous for carnivores
who have tasted meat.</i>

20:46.245 --> 20:50.290
<i>The smallest dose
can lead to violent side effects</i>

20:50.374 --> 20:54.086
<i>and intense cravings for meat.</i>

20:56.672 --> 20:59.049
<i>My first real hard-earned money.</i>

21:00.259 --> 21:03.011
<i>Now I can pay my rent
and electricity bill.</i>

21:03.095 --> 21:05.305
<i>Maybe I can even get Haru some flowers.</i>

21:06.223 --> 21:08.934
<i>I feel like I might actually be okay.</i>

21:09.768 --> 21:15.107
<i>So... I don't want to keep secrets
from Haru any longer.</i>

21:19.111 --> 21:22.698
Hey, you! Good evening!

21:22.781 --> 21:23.865
Good evening.

21:26.952 --> 21:30.205
How about an energy drink
made just for carnivores?

21:31.123 --> 21:33.709
You must be tired, right?

21:33.792 --> 21:38.505
It would seem the dealers aren't
aware of the harm it can cause.

21:40.632 --> 21:42.467
Depending how things play out,

21:42.551 --> 21:46.096
it could lead to
carnivore-on-carnivore killings.

21:47.931 --> 21:50.851
I've got plenty of energy, thanks.

21:50.934 --> 21:53.854
Hey, now, don't be shy.

21:53.937 --> 21:55.897
How about a free sample?

23:36.915 --> 23:41.920
Subtitle translation by: Thomas Grathwol
